{"id":"656249","name":"芝麻花生汤圆","author":"两米阳光9","authorId":"10083606","desc":"","cover":"images/656249/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"五宝粉","amount":"110g(or芝麻粉)"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"180ml"},{"name":"花生粉","amount":"40g"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"70g(or猪油)"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"30g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"35g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五宝粉or芝麻粉110g，花生粉40g，黄油or猪油70g（黄油提前隔水融化），清水35g，白糖30g，混合均匀，冷冻。","img":"images/656249/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷冻定型以后分成8-9g一个丸子。","img":"images/656249/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"继续冷冻。","img":"images/656249/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"糯米粉250g，开水180g，慢慢倒入用筷子混合均匀，带手套揉搓至无干粉，保鲜膜盖好醒20分钟。","img":"images/656249/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搓成12-13g一个的球。","img":"images/656249/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放止风干用保鲜膜盖住。","img":"images/656249/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把冻好的馅料用虎口慢慢包进皮里。","img":"images/656249/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"裹一点糯米粉防粘。","img":"images/656249/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"裹好了，烧开水。","img":"images/656249/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"水开放汤圆。","img":"images/656249/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全部飘起来就熟了。","img":"images/656249/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"自己做的真材实料。","img":"images/656249/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"还可以控糖，非常好吃。吃不完的可以冷冻。","img":"images/656249/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}